'''The Cleft''' is a corrupted [[furbolg]] den located north west of [[Dolanaar]] in [[Teldrassil]]. The furbolg here are part of the [[Gnarlpine tribe]] and are led by [[Ursal the Mauler]]. They ambushed travelers along the road to [[Darnassus]] and were holding a group of [[Druid of the Talon|slumbering druids]] captive. [[Moon Priestess Amara]] and her bodyguards guarded the road near the entrance.

